   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Regional Sem Hosptials</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Regionalt sem om sjukhus</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Hospital Sector Reforms are known to be difficult to implement. The health sector reforms that have swept the global healht scene since the 80s have in most cases resultet in a more efficient use of resources at the primary level while the hospitals have been left more or less untouched. This seminar intends to bring together policymakers to discuss the issue in our partner countries.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Internationellt seminarium om sjukhussektorns roll i h&#xE4;lsosystemet. Syftet &#xE4;r att diskutera hur sjukhussektorn kan inkorporeras i p&#xE5;g&#xE5;ende h&#xE4;lsoreformer p&#xE5; ett mer effektivt s&#xE4;tt och hur sjukhusen kan medverka till en f&#xF6;rb&#xE4;ttrad h&#xE4;lsov&#xE5;rd i v&#xE5;ra samarbetsl&#xE4;nder. Forts&#xE4;ttning p&#xE5; seminarium i G&#xF6;teborg ins nr 72300027</narrative>
  </description>
